## Pitfalls and limitations

- Technical confounder
- Statistical limitation
- Biological over-interpretation to avoid

## Checklist

- [ ] Design and controls documented
- [ ] Software versions and references recorded
- [ ] QC thresholds justified
- [ ] Results validated with an independent view

